{"id":"n70896-2-7","stage":2,"title":"제대로 · 圆满地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70896-2-7-1","ko":"오늘 공연은 힘들어 보이던데요?","zh":"今天的演出看起来好辛苦啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공연은","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들어","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이던데요?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f1c89677ed8d3a56a8a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70896-2-7-2","ko":"네, 조금 힘들었어요. 제대로 목소리가 안 나왔어요.","zh":"是的，确实有点辛苦。声音根本发不出来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들었어요.","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"圆满地","explanation":"제대로：圆满地","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"2","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목소리가","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔어요.","meaning":"出来，播放出来","explanation":"나오다：出来，播放出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"22","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"圆满地","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"跟下定决心一样地。","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出来，播放出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"可以听到或看到广播电视节目。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f7624fdfc0f8d6d0933.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70896","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.5602,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，确实有点辛苦。声音根本发不出来。","今天的演出看起来好辛苦啊？","电话断了，很抱歉。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天的演出看起来好辛苦啊？","电话断了，很抱歉。","是的，确实有点辛苦。声音根本发不出来。"],"answer":2}]}
